msgstr "Facturación"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1982
msgid "No Preference"
msgstr "Sin preferencia"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1987
msgid "Instant Payments "
msgstr "Pagos instantáneos "

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1991
msgid ""
"If you enable this setting, PayPal will be instructed not to allow the "
"buyer to use funding sources that take additional time to complete (for "
"example, eChecks). Instead, the buyer will be required to use an instant "
"funding source, such as an instant transfer, a credit/debit card, or PayPal "
"Credit."
msgstr ""
"Si habilitas este ajuste, se le indicará a PayPal que no permita al "
"comprador usar fuentes de financiación que tarden tiempo adicional en "
"completarse (por ejemplo, eChecks). En su lugar, se requerirá que el "
"comprador use una fuente de financiación instantánea, como una "
"transferencia instantánea, una tarjeta de crédito/débito o PayPal Credit."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1994
msgid "Require Instant Payment"
msgstr "Requerir pago instantáneo"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1997
msgid "Billing Address"
msgstr "Dirección de facturación"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1998
msgid "Use PayPal Shipping Address as Billing"
msgstr "Usar la dirección de envío de PayPal como facturación"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:1999
msgid ""
"If the billing address is empty and PayPal provides a shipping address, the "
"order will use the shipping address as the billing address."
msgstr ""
"Si la dirección de facturación está vacía y PayPal proporciona una "
"dirección de envío, el pedido usará la dirección de envío como dirección de "
"facturación."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-settings.php:2005
